    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d79">

                <pb facs="0087" n="81" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg81"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 80.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Pelting</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-23"><hi rendition="#italic">November 23,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Yesterday China made through me direct overtures to Japan for peace; basis,
                    independence Korea; war indemnity. Unless peace made ask Secretary of the Navy
                    strengthen <hi rendition="#italic">Monocacy</hi> crew fifty men for service
                    Peking.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
